%% backgrounds.mgp - gucOS MagicPoint showcase (todos/0185): %bgrad
%% gradients (directions, palettes). The parameter walk-through follows
%% upstream sample/gradation.mgp; the pages here are ours.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "black", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Backgrounds

gradients in four directions
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad

Default

%size 4
\%bgrad with no arguments: blue to black, top down
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 0 0 256 90 1 "black" "DeepSkyBlue"

Sideways

%size 4
direction 90: left to right
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 0 0 256 180 1 "DarkGreen" "black"

Bottom up

%size 4
direction 180 climbs instead
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 0 0 256 45 1 "MidnightBlue" "orchid" "gold"

Three stops

%size 4
any color list works: MidnightBlue, orchid, gold
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 30 30 256 0 0 "gray40" "black"

Tiles

%size 4
xsize/ysize below 100 tile the pattern
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: effects.mgp
